WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.060
Hello, everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome to "Chook and Sosig: A Case of Murder."

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.960
Now we've played Chook and Sosig before but this is a demo for the full game

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.600
that they're going to be releasing very soon in the future.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.500
And it's a visual novel with a lot of cutesy, cutesy-poopsie stuff. "Welcome to the neighborhood!"

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.680
*upbeat music plays in the background* "This is an odd corner of the world where the sun never rises."

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.100
"Tonight something horrible will take place here."

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.260
"We will follow a ghost named Chook..."

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:31.199
"...and the cat named Sosig who can see them."

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:37.360
"Let's begin, shall we?" Also, the cat has strange, really long noodle arms so watch out for that.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.300
"Hey, it's okay, Tex. Don't worry about it so much."

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.920
"I know you well enough by now, you didn't mean it."

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.800
"Thanks, but no, it's not okay."

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.240
"No, hey, look at me. Really, it is. If I say it's okay, it's okay"

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:54.500
"You're right, of course. I really do need to start spending more time with you."

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.900
"Tex shuffles anxiously, avoiding Bo's gaze."

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.520
"Ah, well actually I've been getting it- giving it some thought lately and

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.740
well, I think we need some time apart."

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:07.560
"You can take the time to concentrate on your writing, and I can try to get my head straight."

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.520
"I think it will help me see things clearer."

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.980
"Hey, whoa! It's late right now, we're both pretty worked up."

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.260
"How 'bout we get some rest and think on it?"

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:19.120
"Come and see me first thing in the morning. How does that sound?"

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.100
"Yeah, okay. That sounds like a good idea."

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:22.280
"G'night."

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:23.860
"Good night and hey..."

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:25.200
"Huh?"

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:26.320
"Don't worry about it."

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:28.000
"kissing noise* "Love you!"

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:32.220
"Tex makes their way slowly through the fields listening to the creatures of the night."

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:36.620
"Down the path towards them, a figure approaches in the dark."

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:37.660
"Hmm?"

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:40.120
"They stop and start as though drunk or disoriented.

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:44.000
pausing every so often to hold their head in their hands and fidget with the sheet of paper."

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:46.940
"As the figure gets closer, it becomes clear who it is."

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.100
Oh, hi, okay!

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:49.760
Hi, Quiz!

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:51.700
How ya doin'?

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.080
"Hey, Quiz."

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.880
"I'm visiting Bo...Wanted to talk."

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.120
"The pink rabbit nervously touches the mask on their face-"

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:03.000
I thought that was their real face! I thought they were wearing a kigurumi!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:04.860
Oh, that's a mask

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:07.100
"- as though to check it's still there."

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:11.560
"Of course you do. Look, Quiz, it's incredibly late, can it really not wait until morning?"

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:12.620
"It's urgent."

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.660
"Well okay, she just headed on home. If you hurry you might still catch her."

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.300
"Thanks. Night, Tex."

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:18.960
"Yeah."

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:24.560
Alright. "Tex stal- stands still on the path, watching Quiz as they quietly disappear again into the night."

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:28.480
"When they can no longer see the pink rabbit he silently continues on his way."

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.080
Okay, gonna get murder- Hi!

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.720
"Hey Chook!"

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.940
"Come 'n' see what I made. "

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.700
I love your 'smokin' hat

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:38.480
"What're ya doin'?

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:39.700
"Baking."

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:40.620
"Why?"

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:44.160
"I've been watching lots of cooking shows and, wow, have I been getting ideas."

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:47.000
About what?  About what, Sosig?

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:51.340
"Well, you are an overflowing font of good ideas, Sosig."

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:53.020
"Don't you know it!"

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:57.480
"See, I'm thinkin' if I bake reeeally good, I can have my very own cooking show!"

00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:03.040
"Like on television. This will be it , Chook! This is my ticket back to fame and fortune."

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:06.320
"I can feel the warm glow of studio lighting on my fur even now!"

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:10.740
For those of you who haven't seen the first video - uh again, links in the description for that one -

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:14.000
Uh, Sosig used to be an adorable kitten

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.500
then the rest of him grew and his face didn't. I think that was the story behind it.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.500
"Oh, 'kay, yep, this will definitely work."

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:26.960
"Exactly! So anyway, I came up with this pretty 10 out of 10 recipe and I called you here for its unveiling."

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:31.300
"Okay, I'm ready. Blow me away with your pure unbridled baking prowess."

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.500
"Feast your eeeeeyes

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.020
on this!" Oh my god, it's amazing

00:03:35.989 --> 00:03:37.989
Is that frog dead?

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:40.030
Is that blood?

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:41.720
"What the heck is that?!"

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:42.519
"My baking!"

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:48.180
"Okay yes, but what is it? As in, what did you place in an oven in order to pull thaaaat out?"

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:53.800
"It's a three-layer lemon torte, topped with standing caramel and chocolate sugar works

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.920
"made lovingly with-

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:59.460
" -with chilis from Satan's secret garden."

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:00.680
Ah

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.360
"You do know there's a frog in there, right?"

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.300
"What frog?"

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.520
"There's a frog staring right at me."

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.700
"I was using my Nana's cookbook and everything."

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:09.960
"We really ought to burn that book."

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:10.800
"Is it really that bad?"

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:15.203
"Let me put it like this: if I weren't already dead, eating that would do it."

00:04:15.203 --> 00:04:17.189
"Damn, so maybe cooking just isn't for me."

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:21.080
"Perhaps. Or perhaps we can find you a real cookbook."

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.240
"Alright I'll go chuck this out then."

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.520
I mean without the frog it might be okay

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.680
"Bon voyage caw-kay."

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.540
"Begone foul bakery!"

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.020
"Bon appetit bin."

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:36.320
"You know maybe I might give another recipe a try. I saw a really nice-sounding trifle in there."

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:39.880
"Really took advantage of ever-underappreciated hoof trimmings."

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:41.540
Ugh

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:42.320
Okay

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:46.500
"Eeeeeeeeee yiike!"

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:48.320
"What the heck was that?"

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:49.760
"Quick let's go see!"

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:53.720
Was it...murde- oh, it was a bat.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.740
Oh, okay. "Oh oh my gosh whoa oh, man. What the hell?"

00:04:58.380 --> 00:04:58.880
"Bo..."

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:03.020
Ohh! Woah! "Hey what's going on-yueeegh!"

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.680
"Chook recoils violently at the sight."

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.520
"Oh man is that... Bo?"

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.060
"I think it used to be."

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:10.580
"I think I'm gonna be sick."

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:12.340
Okay, bye.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:13.480
"Blaaargh."

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.160
Are you just loud in everything you do, Bat? Okay.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:22.260
"Get it all out." That's hardly the advice to give someone who's vomiting.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.460
"Ah man, this really doesn't look like an accident does it?"

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:32.740
"Yeah I'm gonna hazard a guess that no, Bo can't cut off her own head with garden shears."

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:34.460
"This was a murder, Chook"

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.120
"Seems that way."

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.380
"Okay, it's time for us to shine as detectives!"

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:40.280
"The neighborhood needs heroes."

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:44.320
"Wait, what? No! This is really the kind of thing you leave up to the experts."

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:47.800
"It's gonna take a few hours at least for the cops to get here from the mainland."

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.620
"That's precious time wasted."

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.660
"I'm sure it's what Bo would have wanted."

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.480
"We hardly even know Bo!"

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:55.380
"In that case then we owe it to her."

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:59.300
"We've lived next door to her for how long? We've never once said hi to her."

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:00.520
"Chook and Sosig!"

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:01.800
"Detectives!"

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:02.600
Bloody hell

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:05.080
O-Oh! Oh! Wow! Wow!

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:11.960
W-Wow whoa, whoa whoa. "Okay, Chook, let's get to work. Not a moment to lose."

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.200
"I hate you."

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:13.700
Okay!

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:15.940
Whoa!

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.400
Ah, how 'bout this note?

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:22.040
"Hey look, Bo is holding onto something."

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:22.980
"It's a photo."

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.980
Oh, no

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.340
"Who is this?"

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:29.420
"That's Tex, Bo's boyfriend. They were such a lovely couple."

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:34.000
"I should really get on the phone with Tex and tell him the bad news. He needs to know."

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:34.880
"Oh you're still here?"

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.980
"I've been about five fo-feet away from you this whole time."

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:41.940
Oh, thank you. Thank you for that. Alright, well, how 'bout the head?

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:42.920
"Poor Bo."

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.940
"Hey look at this! It looks like she was struck on the back of the head."

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:49.520
"I think she may have died before her head was remoooved."

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:51.360
Gross.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:52.780
Alright

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:54.740
Oh-that-don't-don't need to go over that again

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:59.140
"Looks like this pot has been moved. There's scuff marks all over the ground."

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.940
"That's weird, why does this pot get moved so much?"

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.000
Let's move it over.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.360
A key!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.160
"What a weird-looking key."

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.100
"I wonder what this opens."

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.160
"No idea, but it looks like a clue."

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.120
"Do you think that's everything?"

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:14.220
I just want to look a little bit longer

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:16.780
Just gotta stare real hard at this...

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.040
...sssite here.

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:19.920
Right.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:23.980
"This lantern is a nice touch. I think we should get some more outdoor lights."

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.020
"We can think about that later."

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:26.720
"Especially with the murderer on the loose."

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:30.320
"I wanna be able to see an attempt on my life in vivid well-lit detail."

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.980
"Wouldn't have it any other way."

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:33.540
"Do you think that's everything?"

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:36.740
Just wanna look a b-just gimme a little-give me more time, gosh.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.620
Ugh. Jesus.

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:40.680
"What are these flowers?"

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.080
"Those are Luna Roses."

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:46.580
"They grow really well in the neighborhood cuz they grow in moonlight and since it's always night they thrive here."

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.620
"It looks as though Bo really liked 'em."

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:52.820
"Do you think that's everything?" Just give me some goddamn second

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.080
Save, I guess.

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:58.800
"Looks like Bo's been potting up plants. Maybe I could take up a gardening."

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.440
"Do you think that's everything?" No.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.220
Okay, I think that's everything.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:04.340
I think it's everything. Yeah, okay, I'm done here.

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:11.280
"Done searching, where to next?" Let's go check on...Let's go check on Min cuz Min's right here

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:15.900
And I dunno what to think about that. "Let's go and take Min home and make sure she's okay."

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:18.180
"Yeah, she looked pretty shaken. Okay, let's go."

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.820
Alright, whatever you say

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.120
"This is your place?"

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.380
"Yeah. It's pretty cozy."

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.360
"I wish I had a house with wheels."

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:26.400
"It does come in handy, I have to admit."

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:31.320
"I was parked out by the expressway, but there was a huge fire out there last month so I moved into the neighborhood."

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:33.060
"Oh, then welcome to the neighborhood!"

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:34.280
Quote, unquote TM

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.140
"Thanks."

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:36.840
"Sosig points to the sign."

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.220
"Are you a magician?"

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:39.840
"What, no! I'm psychic."

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:43.680
"Chook snaps angrily, both unheard and unseen by Min."

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:46.320
"She's a fraud and a crook, that's what she is!

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:50.060
"Sosig stares at Chook with a shocked expression."

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:51.080
"What are you looking at?"

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:55.140
"Oh, nothing, sorry. I was just imagining how exciting it must be to have magical powers."

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.700
"Min nods softly while smiling."

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:57.920
"It's truly a gift."

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:59.700
Ah, okay. Oh!

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:04.420
"Welcome to my home." Oh my gosh. It's so cute in here. I love it.

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:06.860
"I'm afraid I'm gonna have to ask you some questions about Bo."

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:08.820
"It's okay. I expected as much."

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:10.280
"Do you know anything about this key at all?"

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:13.669
"Can't say I've ever seen that key before, unfortunately."

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.080
"Ah, that's a shame."

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:17.700
"Can you try and contact the ghost of Bo at all?"

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.280
"Not easily. Whoever killed Bo knew- knew what they were doing."

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.880
They got the ghost!

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:24.700
Right into the ground they did!

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:25.360
"What do you mean?"

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:32.460
"Bo's head was removed and the photo of a loved one was in place in her hand. It ensures her spirit does not remain trapped in this mortal coil."

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:32.980
"Where does it go?"

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.160
"Straight to the other side."

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:37.820
"So it's still possible to contact her?"

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:40.840
"It'll take some time to prepare but I believe I can."

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.760
"Can't believe you're listening to this."

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:46.100
Let's see... How come you were at Booo's?

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:52.580
"I go there once a week usually.  Bo grows heaps of the roses, and I like to take some back here to freshen up the place."

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:55.200
"We tend to chat a while, talk about what we're both doing."

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.660
"So just a friendly visit?"

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:00.820
"Yeah, helps break up the tedium. I get some flowers and Bo gets her fortune once a week."

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:05.220
"Tch, wow. I take it her otherworldly gift didn't see this coming then."

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:08.880
"So strange her fortune was really positive last week about coming success."

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.720
Huh yeah, funny about that.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:13.920
"Fortune tellers are all crooks and thieves." Says the ghost

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.640
"She had good fortune coming to her?"

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:22.460
"That's how I saw it anyway. She pulled the Crown of Morning. It's great card for success and coming wealth."

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:25.460
"Fate does indeed play cruel tricks on us sometimes."

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:26.640
"Pah!"

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:31.800
You mean you were totally wrong, is that how that be? Like as if you were guessing

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.600
"There's not very much room."

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.960
"Well I am a bat and since it's constantly nighttime here I don't really need a bed."

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:40.240
"Being noc- naturally nocturnal is another of my gifts."

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:42.200
"Don't you still get tired though?"

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.840
"Oh, extremely. But that's what energy drinks are for."

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:45.680
Healthy.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:48.780
"The wheels are particularly handy because I can move at a moment's notice."

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:49.540
True.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.680
"If I don't like the neighbors, not a problem. I just hitch up and move."

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:54.380
"So how do you move it though?"

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:59.120
"Well I did have a mule but it got spooked by that fire near the expressway a while back and bolted."

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:05.720
"I got Tex and Exley to help me pull it this time. It wasn't far, but I'm not really sure I can move it again now.

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:08.400
Alright. "What's this about 70 cent fortunes?"

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:12.400
"I'm trying to attract business. Extremely cheap fortunes to first-time customers."

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:12.980
"Is it working?"

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:14.580
"Business is slow."

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:16.660
"Can you tell my fortune?!"

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:19.940
"You don't actually believe in this shit, do ya?"

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:21.680
"Well do you have 70 cents?"

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:27.280
"As luck or fate would have it, I just so happen to have exactly 70 cents. Hit me!"

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:28.500
"Fair enough, let's see here."

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:33.660
"Min quietly allows herself to be drawn to 3 cards and pulls them out, laying them on the table face down."

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:35.420
"Okay pick one of these."

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.140
"Please, allow yourself a moment and let the cards speak to you."

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:39.820
"Let the choice occur naturally."

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.800
How else would it happen? ...How else would it happen?

